&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.6pt;padding-right:0.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.6pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・仕入・調達コストの&lt;/span&gt;増加による原料コストの増加&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.6pt;padding-right:0.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.6pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・製造にかかるエネル&lt;/span&gt;ギーコストの増加による操業コストの増加&lt;/p&gt;
